They selected her, and now I
think she's being manipulated,

00:52:05.190 --> 00:52:07.160
and they took a sort of pretty girl

00:52:07.160 --> 00:52:09.630
who just likes getting up
there and saying anything.

00:52:09.630 --> 00:52:13.250
And that that strikes me
as actually dangerous.

00:52:13.250 --> 00:52:15.750
- First of all, I completely disagree

00:52:15.750 --> 00:52:18.040
on her intelligence and capability.

00:52:18.040 --> 00:52:20.280
- Well, no, I'm not saying
her capability's not good.

00:52:20.280 --> 00:52:21.340
I think she's playing a role.

00:52:21.340 --> 00:52:23.077
So the capability is there.

00:52:23.077 --> 00:52:26.430
I think the actual intelligence behind it,

00:52:26.430 --> 00:52:27.938
I don't think, is that great.

00:52:27.938 --> 00:52:29.170
I think maybe we're talking about

00:52:29.170 --> 00:52:31.780
a different type of intelligence here.

00:52:31.780 --> 00:52:34.640
- Certainly she has the
political intelligence.

00:52:34.640 --> 00:52:36.840
She has the psychological intelligence.

00:52:36.840 --> 00:52:38.710
Social intelligence.

00:52:38.710 --> 00:52:41.530
And she obviously knows
more than most people

00:52:41.530 --> 00:52:44.690
