00:53:42.830 --> 00:53:43.970
But some of the smartest people--

00:53:43.970 --> 00:53:45.650
- Yeah, I think Yang is four.

00:53:45.650 --> 00:53:46.610
I think.

00:53:46.610 --> 00:53:48.250
We should confirm that.
- I believe so.

00:53:48.250 --> 00:53:51.620
But some of the smartest people
