00:58:55.110 --> 00:58:57.210
Things are going really well with me.

00:58:57.210 --> 00:58:59.297
So look for people who
believe in the simulation

00:58:59.297 --> 00:59:01.920
and then say to yourself,
"How's it going?"

00:59:01.920 --> 00:59:03.670
And you're gonna find a pattern

00:59:03.670 --> 00:59:06.083
