00:59:07.140 --> 00:59:08.030
- So you're saying whether I

00:59:08.030 --> 00:59:09.380
believe in the simulation or not,

00:59:09.380 --> 00:59:10.550
I probably should just try to

00:59:10.550 --> 00:59:12.080
believe in it a little bit more.

00:59:12.080 --> 00:59:12.950
- The people who--

00:59:12.950 --> 00:59:15.280
You're saying if this is a simulation,

00:59:15.280 --> 00:59:16.980
that if I believe it's a simulation

00:59:16.980 --> 00:59:18.420
this video will be monetized.

00:59:18.420 --> 00:59:19.770
I think that's what you're saying.

00:59:19.770 --> 00:59:21.700
- Let's concentrate really hard.

00:59:21.700 --> 00:59:24.090
Monetize, monetize.

00:59:24.090 --> 00:59:26.170
Yes, I believe that you will find a way

00:59:26.170 --> 00:59:29.840
to vast monetization
if you accept, accept,

00:59:29.840 --> 00:59:32.380
pray with me, the simulation.

